### Variables (usa la extensión REST Client de VS Code)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Health
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@emprendesmart.com",
  "password": "Admin123*"
}

### Perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard - resumen general
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard - crecimiento de emprendedores
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/growth?months=12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard - uso de la plataforma
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/usage?months=12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard - negocios por categoría
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/businesses-by-category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard - señales del sistema (recomendaciones + alertas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/signals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar emprendedores
GET {{baseUrl}}/entrepreneurs?page=1&limit=10&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear emprendedor
POST {{baseUrl}}/entrepreneurs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Nueva",
  "lastName": "Emprendedora",
  "email": "nueva@example.com",
  "country": "Perú",
  "city": "Lima",
  "plan": "PRO"
}

### Listar negocios
GET {{baseUrl}}/businesses?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar métrica mensual de un negocio
PUT {{baseUrl}}/businesses/BUSINESS_ID/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "period": "2026-08-01",
  "revenue": 15000,
  "expenses": 9000,
  "customersCount": 120,
  "salesCount": 340
}

### Listar recomendaciones pendientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations?status=PENDING&priority=HIGH
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambiar estado de una recomendación
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/RECOMMENDATION_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ACCEPTED" }

### Listar alertas abiertas
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts?status=OPEN&severity=CRITICAL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resolver una alerta
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/alerts/ALERT_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "RESOLVED", "resolutionNote": "Se contactó al emprendedor y se ajustó el flujo de caja." }
